    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_evelyn_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "小姐待下人很好。她教我认字。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_evelyn_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_evelyn_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 3.042667,
      "bytes": 29919
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_evelyn_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "二楼最里面她住过的房间一直锁着，备用钥匙我替她收在围裙口袋里。这会儿少爷在客厅等您，晚些没人的时候我再把钥匙拿给您。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_evelyn_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_evelyn_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 11.9,
      "bytes": 105745
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "……是我寄的。信退回宅子，压在老爷的文书里，我整理东西时翻出来的。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 6.4,
      "bytes": 58828
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L03",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "信封里那张『请务必来』的便条，也是我放的。我不知道还能找谁。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L03.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L03.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 5.8,
      "bytes": 54131
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L04",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "小姐写这封信的时候，一直在等您的回信。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L04.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L04.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 3.6,
      "bytes": 34916
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L05",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "您先见过少爷吧。有些话，得等他不在场我才能说。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L05.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_b1_L05.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.8,
      "bytes": 44092
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_wait_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "少爷在客厅壁炉边等您。二楼房间的钥匙我收在身上，等您见过少爷和医生，来餐厅门边找我。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_wait_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_wait_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 8.4,
      "bytes": 76007
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "少爷在长桌尽头等您，格雷医生刚到门厅。等您先问过医生那晚的事，再来找我拿二楼的钥匙。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 8.4,
      "bytes": 76039
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b5_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "您还有什么要问的吗？",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b5_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b5_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 1.76,
      "bytes": 19047
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b5_01_R01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "您还有什么要问的吗？",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b5_01_R01.wav",
