    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "忌日前一晚，少爷披着它出去过。回来时，袖口上都是崖边的草籽。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 7.1,
      "bytes": 63726
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "他没说去了哪儿。我也没问。那件斗篷我本来想收起来，可他没让。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 6,
      "bytes": 53985
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L03",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "您别在他面前提。他这一晚已经很难熬了。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L03.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_cloak_01_L03.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4,
      "bytes": 38336
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "少爷让留的。她说小姐没见到人，位置就不能撤。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.4,
      "bytes": 42627
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "披肩是她自己缝的边。我每天摆餐具时都要摸一下，确认还在。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 5.5,
      "bytes": 51328
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L03",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "这屋子里总得有人记得她坐哪儿。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L03.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_dinner_seat_01_L03.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.56,
      "bytes": 26479
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "小姐每次写完信，都会问我：邮差今天会不会来。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 5.5,
      "bytes": 49862
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "后来她就不问了。信写好，放在抽屉里，过几天自己再看一遍。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 6.1,
      "bytes": 55330
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L03",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "最后那封没写完。她写到一半，把笔放下了。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L03.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letters_01_L03.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.3,
      "bytes": 39942
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "……是我寄的。小姐写好后一直压在老爷的文书里。我想，总得有人知道。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 7.1,
      "bytes": 63612
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_02_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "小姐说过，如果她出了什么事，就把这封信寄出去。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_02_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_02_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.7,
      "bytes": 43781
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_02_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我拖了一年。我怕。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_02_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_letter_02_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.4,
      "bytes": 24110
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我在。我在楼下等门。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.16,
      "bytes": 22151
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "……我听见书房有声音。两个人的声音。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4,
      "bytes": 37585
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_02_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我站在楼梯口。灯是亮的。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_02_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_02_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.4,
      "bytes": 24440
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_02_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "后来……少爷和医生抬着什么东西下来。用床单裹着。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_02_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_02_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 5.4,
      "bytes": 50063
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_03_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "他们给了我一份工钱，和一句话：『老爷身体不好，别让他知道。』",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_03_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_03_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 5.7,
      "bytes": 52224
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_03_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我拿了钱。这一年，我每天都在想这件事。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_03_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_03_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 3.842667,
      "bytes": 35820
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_04_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "医生说她没气了。我不知道。我没敢看。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_04_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_04_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.2,
      "bytes": 38922
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_04_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "但她的手是暖的。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_04_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_night_04_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 1.44,
      "bytes": 16674
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "二楼最里面是她的房间。出事以后少爷让人锁上了，备用钥匙一直在我围裙口袋里。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 8.1,
      "bytes": 73182
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L03",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "收进您的随身背包里，别让少爷知道是我给的。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L03.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L03.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 3.682667,
      "bytes": 36297
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L04",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "……小姐出事那天下午，还去门厅邮箱看过一回。其实她知道邮差早上已经来过了。她的梳妆台和衣柜一直没人动过，您可以上去看看。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L04.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_room_01_L04.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 12.1,
      "bytes": 108431
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "书房我打扫过。壁炉里的纸……是先生让我烧的。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 5.6,
      "bytes": 51042
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我留了一角。我说不上为什么。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.88,
      "bytes": 28236
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_02_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "小姐在查船上的事。先生知道。他让我别多嘴。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_02_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_study_02_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.8,
      "bytes": 45386
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b9_wait_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我什么都不知道。少爷在书房。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b9_wait_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_b9_wait_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.8,
      "bytes": 27782
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_confront_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "您要我在午夜说出来吗？",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_confront_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_confront_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.24,
      "bytes": 23672
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_will_testify_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "……好。我欠小姐一句话。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_will_testify_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_will_testify_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.08,
      "bytes": 21204
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_hesitate_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "说出来，我这份工就没了。这地方是我唯一的家。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_hesitate_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_hesitate_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 4.3,
      "bytes": 40121
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "午夜了，先生。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 1.44,
      "bytes": 15959
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L01_MISS",
      "variant": "miss",
      "text": "午夜了，小姐。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L01_MISS.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L01_MISS.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 1.6,
      "bytes": 16900
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我就在门边。需要的时候，我在。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_01_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 3.122667,
      "bytes": 30684
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_testified_L01",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "我答应过小姐。天一亮，我就去说。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_testified_L01.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_testified_L01.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 3.042667,
      "bytes": 29766
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_testified_L02",
      "variant": "base",
      "text": "您做您的决定。我不催您。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_npc_housekeeper/source_plus_longanlingxin/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_testified_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_NpcHousekeeper_npc_housekeeper_midnight_testified_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 2.16,
      "bytes": 22261
    }
  ]
